          { q: "What is a creator network?", a: "A creator network is an organized pool of vetted UGC creators that a brand or agency can activate for content production. Unlike a marketplace where you search for individuals, a network is pre-built infrastructure with established workflows for matching, briefing, quality control, and payment." },
          { q: "Why is a network better than hiring individual creators?", a: "Networks provide speed (instant deployment vs weeks of sourcing), variety (multiple styles and niches on demand), redundancy (replacements when creators drop out), and scale (ramp production up or down without rebuilding). Individual hiring works for 1–2 videos but breaks down at volume." },
